      "description": "ahmed gradle-patterns: build-logic/convention/build.gradle.kts references undefined catalog accessors libs.android.gradlePlugin / libs.kotlin.gradlePlugin, and there is no build-logic/settings.gradle.kts recreating the catalog (major).",
