      "reasoning": "Verified. Line 164 is ./gradlew cleanBuildCache; line 15 pins agp = \"8.2.2\". The Android-specific build cache and its cleanBuildCache task were deprecated in AGP 4.1 and removed in AGP 7.0, so on AGP 8.2.2 the task is absent and the command fails with 'Task cleanBuildCache not found in root project'. The finding correctly notes the adjacent rm -rf ~/.gradle/caches (line 165) is still valid. Accurate."
    }
  ],
  "missedIssues": [
